ghost-role-information-forged-name = Forged

ghost-role-information-forged-description = My mechanism will not let me sleep until I have fixed everything.

ghost-role-information-forged-rules = You are a sentient being. You may either roleplay as a free Forged, or as a controlled creature serving your master or masters. Once you choose that roleplay, keep to it. The same rules apply to you as to an ordinary humanoid.

